  "description": "ETEXOT crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C104 H96 Er4 N18 O22 Zn2 2+,2(C2 H3 N1),2(Na1 1+),0.9(N1 O3 1-),3.1(N3 1-),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Er1A (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er2A (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Zn1A (Zn) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.516-3.758 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.21-109.20°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn2Er4(L1)4(L2)2(OAc)2(N3)2][Na2(OH2)2(NO3)0.9(N3)3.1]·2MeCN (C108H106Er4N30.2Na2O26.7Zn2). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 0 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 0 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
